title: "moderndive: Python companion for ModernDive"
abstract: >-
  A Python companion package for ModernDive (Statistical Inference via Data
  Science), providing a tidy simulation-inference grammar, regression helpers,
  and datasets, built on polars, plotnine, and statsmodels.
